flowchart TB
  client["API client (host or network)<br/>gRPC over HTTP/2 · bearer token"]
  cells["CELLS: units of isolation and accounting<br/>system cell (control plane, a native service) · container cells (Linux processes from OCI images)"]
  abis["PERSONALITIES: the system-call ABI a process speaks<br/>Linux ABI (~190 syscalls, io_uring, /proc, ptys) · native ABI v2 (capability handles only)"]
  kernel["KERNEL SERVICES: safe Rust, forbid(unsafe_code)<br/>processes, threads, signals, futexes, pipes · address spaces (CoW fork, demand paging)<br/>VFS (overlay roots, verified page cache) · network (a TCP/UDP stack per cell, switch, NAT)<br/>capabilities and cell accounts · scheduler policy (fair share)"]
  drivers["DRIVERS: safe Rust over frame's MMIO and DMA types<br/>virtio-blk · NVMe · virtio-net · virtio-rng"]
  frame["FRAME: the one unsafe kernel crate (about 5,800 lines, budgeted and linted)<br/>boot · page tables · ring 3 entry · tasks · interrupts · MMIO · DMA · TLB shootdown · side-channel mitigations"]
  hw["UEFI firmware and x86-64 hardware<br/>QEMU/KVM · cloud VMs · bare metal"]

  client -->|"gRPC"| cells
  cells --> abis
  abis --> kernel
  kernel --> drivers
  drivers --> frame
  frame --> hw
